| Is any arm more similar to authentic YSL? | `NOT TESTED`; these are documentary character hypotheses, not authenticated recipes. |
| Is any arm more hedonic than Sol xhigh? | `NOT TESTED`; no blinded physical observations exist. |
| Did DeepLuna beat Sol? | No comparison was run; the exact-project route was blocked before transmission. |

## Program-efficiency measurement

The upgraded `scan-formulas` path now executes a deterministic static stage before physics, derives each formula's declared concentrate volume, records parse/static/full/cache timing, and permits cache reuse only with exact formula, authoritative inventory, inventory-overlay, configuration, and pipeline-source hashes. Cache use is disabled when audit logging is enabled so reuse cannot suppress a required audit event.

Fresh measurements in this isolated worktree at 305 K:

| Scope | Cold | Exact warm reuse | End-to-end change |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| LH-01 staged scan | 7.140 s | 0.248 s | 28.8x faster |
| All 20 YSL variants | 66.411 s | 0.359 s | 184.9x faster |

The cold 20-arm run produced 20 WARN, 0 FAIL and took 65.919 s inside the full gates. The warm run returned 20/20 exact cache hits and reused 66.080 s of bound computation. These are local pipeline timings, not model-generation timings and not evidence of sensory quality.

The prospective matched comparison is now defined in `testing/blind_protocol.json` as XHIGH alone, XHIGH with the current program, XHIGH with the upgraded program, and optional Ultra with the same upgraded program. A fresh matched XHIGH generation run has **not** occurred; the frozen historical baselines remain diagnostic context only.

## Executable matched benchmark and realism intake

The existing audit CLI now executes the protocol rather than leaving it as prose:

```powershell
python scripts/pipeline_audit.py compare-benchmark `
  --protocol formulas/ysl_twenty_variant_study/testing/blind_protocol.json `
  --receipts <matched-receipt-bundle.json> `
  --json
```

Each A/B/C receipt is bound to one brief and run, the exact model and reasoning effort, formula bytes, prompt contract, inventory, stock basis, evaluation-pipeline source, concentration, temperature, time budget, output schema, and declared metrics. Duplicate canonical cells, artifact-hash failures, and matched-control mismatches invalidate the comparison instead of being averaged away. Optional arm D is evaluated only when supplied.

Running the command without a receipt bundle currently returns `HOLD_MISSING_RECEIPTS`: 0 of 27 required A/B/C pilot cells exist. Sensory status is `NOT_TESTED`, ties and missing cells are never imputed, and no fresh XHIGH or Ultra superiority claim exists.

The same evaluator accepts accord-realism observations conservatively. The user's physical feedback that LH-04 Apple Pie's accords could be more realistic is evidence about LH-04 only; it is not evidence that the other nineteen files fail. A realism defect becomes eligible for human rule review only after it recurs in at least two distinct blinded, identity-retaining formulas and two independent batches. Even then, automatic formula or optimizer mutation remains forbidden.

