## Next valid comparison

Generate every locked A/B/C pilot cell, preserve its exact receipt, and run `compare-benchmark` before interpreting speed or discovery. Compound only after verifying the remaining percentage-stock labels. Use equal-mass, equal-concentration, coded samples in balanced order. Score family identity before variant quality and liking at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Retain ties. No release, stability, safety, or superiority claim follows from the computational screen.
